1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Tarixdagi taniqli shaxs haqida.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
1-qism: Samuraylar oʻyini va Miyamoto Musashi

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:16,308
Kecha yangi oʻyin oʻynadim.

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,787
Qanday oʻyin?

5
00:00:18,811 --> 00:00:22,945
Yapon samuraylari haqidagi oʻyin.

6
00:00:22,968 --> 00:00:25,901
Juda qiziqarli edi.

7
00:00:25,924 --> 00:00:27,964
Yaxshi ekan!

8
00:00:27,988 --> 00:00:30,721
Unda kimlar chiqadi?

9
00:00:30,744 --> 00:00:34,480
Miyamoto Musashi degan odam chiqadi.

10
00:00:34,504 --> 00:00:38,537
Aa, Miyamoto Musashimi?

11
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:41,527
Juda mashhur odam ekan-ku.

12
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:43,240
Ha.

13
00:00:43,264 --> 00:00:46,997
Lekin men uni yaxshi bilmayman.

14
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,273
U qanday odam edi?

15
00:00:49,297 --> 00:00:55,464
Miyamoto Musashi – qadimiy Yaponiyaning kuchli qilichbozi edi.

16
00:00:55,488 --> 00:00:57,421
Qilichbozmi?

17
00:00:57,444 --> 00:01:00,611
U qanchalik kuchli edi?

18
00:01:00,634 --> 00:01:04,003
60 martadan ortiq jang qilgan.

19
00:01:04,026 --> 00:01:07,714
Va bir marta ham yutqazmagan.

20
00:01:07,738 --> 00:01:12,515
Vay, bir marta ham yutqazmaganmi?

21
00:01:12,538 --> 00:01:15,033
Ajoyib!

22
00:01:15,057 --> 00:01:16,900
Ha.

23
00:01:16,923 --> 00:01:21,057
Yaponiyada eng kuchli boʻlgan deyiladi.

24
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:25,972
Oʻyinda ikki qilich ushlab turardi.

25
00:01:25,995 --> 00:01:27,886
Ha, shunday.

26
00:01:27,910 --> 00:01:32,310
Musashi ikki qilich bilan jang qilar edi.

27
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:34,700
Odatda bitta qilich bilanmi?

28
00:01:34,723 --> 00:01:36,656
Ha.

29
00:01:36,679 --> 00:01:41,412
Odatda bitta qilich bilan, lekin Musashi ikki qilich ishlatardi.

30
00:01:41,435 --> 00:01:44,371
Bu kamdan-kam uchraydi.

31
00:01:44,395 --> 00:01:47,428
Stili juda zoʻr.

32
00:01:47,451 --> 00:01:49,318
Ha.

33
00:01:49,341 --> 00:01:53,994
Shuning uchun ham hozirgacha filmlar va animelarda mashhur.

34
00:01:54,018 --> 00:01:58,957
Musashi faqat jang qilish bilanmi shugʻullangan?

35
00:01:58,981 --> 00:02:02,989
Yoʻq, u surat chizishni ham yaxshi bilardi.

36
00:02:03,012 --> 00:02:05,462
Kitoblar ham yozgan.

37
00:02:05,486 --> 00:02:08,931
Vay, kitoblar ham yozganmi?

38
00:02:08,955 --> 00:02:11,288
Qanday kitoblar?

39
00:02:11,311 --> 00:02:14,544
“Go Rin Sho” (Besh halqa kitobi) deb nomlangan kitob.

40
00:02:14,567 --> 00:02:17,251
Jang qilish usullari haqidagi kitob.

41
00:02:17,275 --> 00:02:21,512
Bu kitobni hozir ham oʻqish mumkinmi?

42
00:02:21,535 --> 00:02:23,268
Ha.

43
00:02:23,291 --> 00:02:26,170
Dunyo boʻylab oʻqiladi.

44
00:02:26,194 --> 00:02:29,162
Chet ellarda ham mashhur ekan.

45
00:02:29,185 --> 00:02:31,038
Ha, shunday.

46
00:02:31,061 --> 00:02:33,795
Biznesmenlar ham koʻp oʻqiydi.

47
00:02:33,817 --> 00:02:38,417
Jang qilish haqidagi kitobni biznesmenlar oʻqiydimi?

48
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:40,882
Qiziqarli!

49
00:02:40,906 --> 00:02:44,514
Chunki uning fikrlash usuli foydali boʻladi.

50
00:02:44,537 --> 00:02:48,419
Men ham bu kitobni oʻqishni xohlardim.

51
00:02:48,443 --> 00:02:53,276
Keyinroq yapon tilidagi oson kitobni ijaraga beraman.

52
00:02:53,299 --> 00:02:55,066
Rahmat.

53
00:02:55,089 --> 00:02:58,222
Oʻyinni ham yanada yaxshi oʻynayman.

54
00:02:58,245 --> 00:03:07,254
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentdan yuklab olish mumkin.

55
00:03:07,254 --> 00:03:08,754
2-Sahna: Oda Nobunaga va Azuchi qal’asi / Oda Nobunaga va Azuchi qal’asi

56
00:03:08,754 --> 00:03:13,165
Bu qal’aning surati qayerda olingan?

57
00:03:13,188 --> 00:03:16,846
Bu Azuchi qal’asining rasmidir.

58
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:20,241
Bu Oda Nobunaganing qal’asidir.

59
00:03:20,265 --> 00:03:23,065
Oda Nobunaga debmi?

60
00:03:23,088 --> 00:03:26,654
Ismini eshitganman.

61
00:03:26,677 --> 00:03:31,415
Yaponiyadagi eng mashhur samuraylardan biri!

62
00:03:31,439 --> 00:03:35,640
Nobunaga qanday odam edi?

63
00:03:35,664 --> 00:03:41,130
Juda kuchli va yangiliklarni yaxshi koʻradigan odam edi.

64
00:03:41,153 --> 00:03:44,356
Yangiliklar deb?

65
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:47,277
Masalan, nima?

66
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:51,867
Chet el nonlari va sharobini yaxshi koʻrardi.

67
00:03:51,890 --> 00:03:58,423
Vay, eski zamon samurayi non va sharobmi?

68
00:03:58,446 --> 00:04:00,141
Ha.

69
00:04:00,164 --> 00:04:05,931
Chet el kiyimlarini kiyib, shlyapa ham kiyib yurgan.

70
00:04:05,954 --> 00:04:08,621
Ajoyib!

71
00:04:08,644 --> 00:04:11,930
Juda zamonaviy ekan!

72
00:04:11,954 --> 00:04:13,638
Ha, shunday.

73
00:04:13,661 --> 00:04:17,097
Soat va yer sharini ham egallagan edi.

74
00:04:17,121 --> 00:04:20,488
Yer sharigacha bor edi deysizmi?

75
00:04:20,511 --> 00:04:22,844
Ajoyib!

76
00:04:22,867 --> 00:04:27,565
Chet el madaniyatiga juda qiziqardi.

77
00:04:27,589 --> 00:04:30,589
Miltiq ham ishlatganmi?

78
00:04:30,612 --> 00:04:32,278
Ha.

79
00:04:32,301 --> 00:04:37,435
Nobunaga janglarda koʻp miltiqlardan foydalangan.

80
00:04:37,458 --> 00:04:41,024
Shuning uchun gʻalaba qozongan ekan.

81
00:04:41,047 --> 00:04:42,781
Ha.

82
00:04:42,804 --> 00:04:48,970
Eski fikrlarni oʻzgartirib, Yaponiyani birlashtirishga harakat qilgan.

83
00:04:48,993 --> 00:04:53,227
Juda aqlli odam boʻlgan ekan.

84
00:04:53,249 --> 00:04:54,939
Ha.

85
00:04:54,962 --> 00:05:01,037
Lekin juda qattiqqoʻl edi, shuning uchun koʻp dushmanlari ham boʻlgan.

86
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:03,660
Qattiqqoʻlmi?

87
00:05:03,683 --> 00:05:05,416
Ha.

88
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:09,172
Oxir-oqibat, oʻz odamlari tomonidan xiyonatga uchradi.

89
00:05:09,195 --> 00:05:13,689
A, bu juda afsuski.

90
00:05:13,712 --> 00:05:19,952
Lekin Nobunaganing gʻoyalari keyinchalik Yaponiyani oʻzgartirdi.

91
00:05:19,976 --> 00:05:23,342
Anime va dramalarda ham koʻp chiqadimi?

92
00:05:23,365 --> 00:05:24,932
Ha.

93
00:05:24,955 --> 00:05:30,355
Koʻp asarlarda zoʻr boshliq sifatida chiqadi.

94
00:05:30,378 --> 00:05:34,545
Shuning uchun ham ismini bilardim.

95
00:05:34,568 --> 00:05:36,101
Ha.

96
00:05:36,124 --> 00:05:41,124
Nobunaganing portreti darsliklarda ham doimo bor.

97
00:05:41,147 --> 00:05:46,914
Navbatda Nobunaga haqidagi filmni koʻray.

98
00:05:46,937 --> 00:05:49,770
Ha, albatta koʻring.

99
00:05:49,793 --> 00:05:53,365
Juda qiziqarli boʻladi!

100
00:05:53,389 --> 00:06:00,494
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

101
00:06:00,494 --> 00:06:01,994
3-Sahna: Shinsengumi va Okita Soji / Shinsengumi va Okita Soji

102
00:06:01,994 --> 00:06:07,727
Kioto – koʻp eski binolari bilan juda chiroyli shahar.

103
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:09,717
Ha, shunday.

104
00:06:09,740 --> 00:06:14,540
Bu yer Shinsengumi bilan bogʻliq joy.

105
00:06:14,563 --> 00:06:17,896
Shinsengumi debmi?

106
00:06:17,919 --> 00:06:20,686
Ismini eshitganman.

107
00:06:20,709 --> 00:06:26,509
Bu – eski zamonda Kiotoni qoʻriqlagan samuraylar guruhi.

108
00:06:26,532 --> 00:06:29,707
U yerda qanday odamlar boʻlgan?

109
00:06:29,731 --> 00:06:35,570
Eng kuchli qilichbozlardan biri – Okita Soji boʻlgan.

110
00:06:35,593 --> 00:06:38,289
Okita Soji debmi?

111
00:06:38,312 --> 00:06:41,246
U qanday odam edi?

112
00:06:41,269 --> 00:06:47,235
Juda yosh va tabassumi juda yoqimli boʻlgan deyiladi.

113
00:06:47,258 --> 00:06:52,828
Vay, kuchli boʻlsa ham tabassumi yoqimli ekanmi?

114
00:06:52,852 --> 00:06:54,485
Ha.

115
00:06:54,508 --> 00:06:58,241
Bolalar bilan oʻynashni yaxshi koʻrardim.

116
00:06:58,264 --> 00:07:01,558
Juda mehribon inson boʻlganingizda.

117
00:07:01,582 --> 00:07:06,949
Lekin qilichni olganda, hech kimdan ortda qolmasdi.

118
00:07:06,972 --> 00:07:10,582
Bunday farq juda zoʻr, shunday emasmi?

119
00:07:10,606 --> 00:07:15,982
Okita qilichining tezligi juda tez boʻlgan ekan.

120
00:07:16,005 --> 00:07:20,072
Raqib yutolmaydi, shundaymi?

121
00:07:20,094 --> 00:07:25,900
Ha, Shinsengumi ichida eng buyuk daho deb atalgan.

122
00:07:25,924 --> 00:07:30,003
Sōji necha yoshgacha yashagan?

123
00:07:30,027 --> 00:07:35,594
Aslida, kasallik tufayli yigirma yoshlarida vafot etgan.

124
00:07:35,617 --> 00:07:40,550
Ha, shunchalik yosh vafot etganmi?

125
00:07:40,573 --> 00:07:42,179
Ha.

126
00:07:42,202 --> 00:07:45,736
Juda qisqa umr edi.

127
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:51,093
Shuning uchun ham hamma yodida qolgan.

128
00:07:51,116 --> 00:07:53,449
Toʻgʻri.

129
00:07:53,472 --> 00:07:57,839
Anime va oʻyinlarda ham juda mashhur qahramon.

130
00:07:57,862 --> 00:08:01,238
Qaysi animelarda chiqadi?

131
00:08:01,261 --> 00:08:07,261
“Fate” va “Hakuōki” kabi koʻplab asarlarda bor.

132
00:08:07,284 --> 00:08:10,851
A, bu asarlarni bilaman.

133
00:08:10,874 --> 00:08:14,440
Qahramonlari juda zoʻr.

134
00:08:14,463 --> 00:08:19,297
Ushbu qahramonlarning prototipi – aynan shu Okita Sōji.

135
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:23,772
Bugun bu yerga kelganimdan xursandman.

136
00:08:23,796 --> 00:08:28,840
Sōji ibodatxonasi ham yaqin, boramizmi?

137
00:08:28,863 --> 00:08:30,630
Ha.

138
00:08:30,653 --> 00:08:33,420
Iltimos, menga yoʻl koʻrsatib qoʻying.

139
00:08:33,443 --> 00:08:34,943
4-Sahna: Choy madaniyati va Rikyu / Choy madaniyati va Rikyu

140
00:08:34,943 --> 00:08:38,961
Bu matcha juda mazali ekan.

141
00:08:38,985 --> 00:08:41,161
Yaxshi.

142
00:08:41,184 --> 00:08:45,589
Choyxonada tinchlik va osoyishtalik bor.

143
00:08:45,613 --> 00:08:47,017
Ha.

144
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:51,973
Yapon choy madaniyatini kim yaratgan?

145
00:08:51,996 --> 00:08:55,663
Sen no Rikyū degan kishi yaratgan.

146
00:08:55,686 --> 00:08:58,375
Sen no Rikyūmi?

147
00:08:58,399 --> 00:09:00,765
Qaysi davrda yashagan?

148
00:09:00,788 --> 00:09:07,555
Oda Nobunaga va Toyotomi Hideyoshi bilan bir davrda, Sengoku davrida yashagan.

149
00:09:07,578 --> 00:09:10,811
Samuraylar davrida yashagan ekan.

150
00:09:10,834 --> 00:09:12,607
Ha.

151
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:16,964
Samuraylarga choy ichishni oʻrgatgan.

152
00:09:16,987 --> 00:09:20,387
Samuraylar ham choy ichganmi?

153
00:09:20,410 --> 00:09:22,068
Ha.

154
00:09:22,091 --> 00:09:27,928
Jangdan oldin yuraklarini tinchlantirish uchun ichishgan.

155
00:09:27,952 --> 00:09:29,624
Tushunarli.

156
00:09:29,647 --> 00:09:33,585
Choy ichish vaqti juda muhim boʻlgan.

157
00:09:33,608 --> 00:09:39,046
Rikyū “vabi-sabi” degan tushunchaga katta ahamiyat bergan.

158
00:09:39,070 --> 00:09:41,636
Vabi-sabimi?

159
00:09:41,659 --> 00:09:43,873
Bu nima degani?

160
00:09:43,897 --> 00:09:50,497
Tinchlik, soddalik va keraksiz narsalardan xoli goʻzallik degani.

161
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:55,053
Shuning uchun choyxona kichik va sodda qilib qurilganmi?

162
00:09:55,076 --> 00:09:57,843
Toʻgʻri.

163
00:09:57,866 --> 00:10:03,351
Hashamatli idishlar oʻrniga sodda idishlardan foydalangan.

164
00:10:03,374 --> 00:10:07,607
Xonaga kirish joyi ham juda kichik ekan.

165
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:10,637
Juda yaxshi payqadingiz.

166
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:15,860
Samuraylar ham qilichlarini tashlab kirishlari kerak boʻlgan.

167
00:10:15,883 --> 00:10:18,083
Vay!

168
00:10:18,107 --> 00:10:21,740
Xonada hamma tengmi?

169
00:10:21,763 --> 00:10:23,297
Ha.

170
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:29,053
Shogun ham, samuray ham hamma bir xil degan qoida.

171
00:10:29,076 --> 00:10:32,442
Bu juda ajoyib fikr ekan.

172
00:10:32,466 --> 00:10:37,675
Rikyu tufayli Yapon choy marosimi mukammal shakllandi.

173
00:10:37,699 --> 00:10:41,783
Rikyu qanday feʼl-atvorli odam edi?

174
00:10:41,806 --> 00:10:47,406
U oʻz uslubidan hech qachon voz kechmaydigan, kuchli irodali odam edi.

175
00:10:47,429 --> 00:10:52,198
Shuning uchun yangi madaniyat yaratishga muvaffaq boʻldi, shundaymi?

176
00:10:52,221 --> 00:10:53,824
Ha.

177
00:10:53,848 --> 00:10:59,525
Bugungi kunda ham Yapon dizayniga katta taʼsir koʻrsatmoqda.

178
00:10:59,548 --> 00:11:04,446
Choy ichib, tarix haqida gaplashish juda yoqimli ekan, shunday emasmi?

179
00:11:04,470 --> 00:11:08,526
Yana bir piyola choy quyaymi?

180
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,583
Ha.

181
00:11:09,606 --> 00:11:11,373
Iltimos.

182
00:11:11,396 --> 00:11:12,896
5-Sahna: Toyotomi Hideyoshining muvaffaqiyat hikoyasi

183
00:11:12,896 --> 00:11:19,163
Vaa, Osaka qal’asi juda katta va ajoyib koʻrinishda ekan!

184
00:11:19,186 --> 00:11:21,477
Rostdan ham shunday.

185
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:26,583
Bu Toyotomi Hideyoshi qurdirgan qal’a.

186
00:11:26,606 --> 00:11:29,543
Toyotomi Hideyoshi degani?

187
00:11:29,567 --> 00:11:31,968
U qanday odam edi?

188
00:11:31,992 --> 00:11:38,449
Hideyoshi Yapon tarixidagi eng dramatik shaxslardan biridir.

189
00:11:38,472 --> 00:11:40,406
Nega?

190
00:11:40,429 --> 00:11:45,674
U avval juda kambagʻal boʻlib, oddiy dehqon edi.

191
00:11:45,697 --> 00:11:49,378
Dehqonlikdan boshlab ketganmi?

192
00:11:49,401 --> 00:11:51,035
Ha.

193
00:11:51,058 --> 00:11:54,191
Pul ham, uy ham yoʻq edi.

194
00:11:54,214 --> 00:11:59,047
Undan qanday qilib Yaponiyaning eng yuqori lavozimiga koʻtarildi?

195
00:11:59,070 --> 00:12:04,904
U Oda Nobunagaga xizmatkor boʻlib kirib, juda mehnat qildi.

196
00:12:04,927 --> 00:12:07,860
Qanday ishlar qildi?

197
00:12:07,883 --> 00:12:13,180
Nobunagaga oyoq kiyimini oʻz koʻksida isitib berardi.

198
00:12:13,204 --> 00:12:17,571
Vay, poyabzalini isitganmi?

199
00:12:17,594 --> 00:12:19,293
Ha.

200
00:12:19,316 --> 00:12:23,883
U juda aqlli va zukko odam edi.

201
00:12:23,906 --> 00:12:27,239
Nobunaga ham xursand boʻlgan boʻlsa kerak.

202
00:12:27,262 --> 00:12:28,795
Ha.

203
00:12:28,818 --> 00:12:33,952
Nobunaga uni juda yaxshi koʻrib, tezda martabasi koʻtarildi.

204
00:12:33,975 --> 00:12:39,008
Va nihoyat, Yaponiyaning eng yuqori lavozimiga erishdi.

205
00:12:39,031 --> 00:12:41,164
Ha, shunday.

206
00:12:41,187 --> 00:12:46,830
Kambagʻal dehqondan shogun boʻlgan odam boshqa yoʻq.

207
00:12:46,854 --> 00:12:50,587
Haqiqatan ham orzu hikoyasi!

208
00:12:50,610 --> 00:12:52,410
Ha.

209
00:12:52,433 --> 00:12:57,600
Hideyoshi dabdabali narsalarni juda yaxshi koʻrardi.

210
00:12:57,623 --> 00:13:00,922
Oltin rangni yaxshi koʻrganini eshitdim.

211
00:13:00,945 --> 00:13:02,478
Ha.

212
00:13:02,501 --> 00:13:08,268
Oltin xonalar yasatib, oltin qal’alar qurdirgan.

213
00:13:08,291 --> 00:13:14,347
Bu Osaka qal’asida ham oltin bezaklar bor, juda chiroyli.

214
00:13:14,370 --> 00:13:19,242
Odamlarni quvontirish uchun koʻplab festivallar uyushtirgan.

215
00:13:19,266 --> 00:13:23,139
Yorqin va quvnoq lider boʻlgan ekan.

216
00:13:23,163 --> 00:13:24,966
Ha.

217
00:13:24,990 --> 00:13:29,661
Shuning uchun ham bugungi kungacha Osakaliklar orasida juda mashhur.

218
00:13:29,684 --> 00:13:34,976
Hideyoshining hayotini bilgach, kuch-quvvat olamiz, shundaymi?

219
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:38,600
Biz ham hech qachon taslim boʻlmaymiz va harakat qilamiz!

220
00:13:38,623 --> 00:13:40,190
Ha.

221
00:13:40,213 --> 00:13:45,646
Ichkariga kirib, koʻrgazmani koʻraylik.

222
00:13:45,669 --> 00:13:47,169
6-Sahna: Edo va Tokugava Ieyasu

223
00:13:47,169 --> 00:13:51,702
Tokio shahri juda gavjum ekan!

224
00:13:51,725 --> 00:13:53,497
Ha, shunday.

225
00:13:53,521 --> 00:13:58,609
Tokio avval „Edo“ deb atalgan.

226
00:13:58,632 --> 00:14:02,472
Edoni kim qurdirgan?

227
00:14:02,496 --> 00:14:06,963
Tokugava Ieyasu degan shogun.

228
00:14:06,986 --> 00:14:10,042
Tokugava Ieyasu degani?

229
00:14:10,065 --> 00:14:13,556
U qanday feʼl-atvorli odam edi?

230
00:14:13,579 --> 00:14:19,027
U juda sabrli boʻlib, uzoq kutishni biladigan odam edi.

231
00:14:19,051 --> 00:14:22,920
Kutishni yaxshi bilganmi?

232
00:14:22,943 --> 00:14:29,343
„U kuylamasa, kuylaguncha kutaman“ degan qoʻshiq bor.

233
00:14:29,366 --> 00:14:31,733
Bu nimani anglatadi?

234
00:14:31,756 --> 00:14:38,033
Qushlar sayramasa ham, ular bir kun sayrashlarini sokin kutmoq ma'nosini bildiradi.

235
00:14:38,057 --> 00:14:40,066
Tushunarli.

236
00:14:40,089 --> 00:14:43,107
Zo'r berib harakat qilmaslik kerak ekan.

237
00:14:43,131 --> 00:14:44,768
Ha.

238
00:14:44,792 --> 00:14:50,792
Oda Nobunaga va Toyotomi Hideyoshi vafot etgandan keyin, oxir-oqibatda yetakchiga aylandi.

239
00:14:50,815 --> 00:14:54,615
Yoshligingizda qiyinchiliklar bormi edi?

240
00:14:54,638 --> 00:14:56,238
Ha.

241
00:14:56,261 --> 00:15:01,531
Bolaligimda garovda edim, ozodligim yo'q edi.

242
00:15:01,554 --> 00:15:05,411
Uzoq vaqt sabr qildingiz ekan.

243
00:15:05,435 --> 00:15:07,047
Ha.

244
00:15:07,070 --> 00:15:11,603
Aynan shuning uchun ham tinchlikning qadrini bilardim.

245
00:15:11,626 --> 00:15:16,839
Ieyasu yaratgan davr qanchalik davom etdi?

246
00:15:16,863 --> 00:15:21,758
Taxminan ikki yuz ellik yil davomida tinchlik hukm surdi.

247
00:15:21,781 --> 00:15:24,468
Ikki yuz ellik yilmi?

248
00:15:24,492 --> 00:15:27,786
Bu juda ajoyib!

249
00:15:27,809 --> 00:15:32,661
Shu davr mobaynida Yaponiyada katta urushlar bo'lmadi.

250
00:15:32,685 --> 00:15:38,485
Shuning uchun ham rakugo va kabuki kabi qiziqarli madaniyatlar yuzaga keldi.

251
00:15:38,508 --> 00:15:40,508
Ha, shunday.

252
00:15:40,531 --> 00:15:45,098
Tinchlik hukm surgani uchun hamma hayotdan zavqlana oldi.

253
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:48,534
Ieyasu uzoq umr ko'rganmi?

254
00:15:48,558 --> 00:15:54,240
O'sha davr uchun g'alati bo'lgani kabi, yetmish uch yoshgacha yashadi.

255
00:15:54,263 --> 00:15:57,797
Albatta, sog'lig'iga ham e'tibor qaratgan ekan.

256
00:15:57,820 --> 00:15:59,420
Ha.

257
00:15:59,443 --> 00:16:05,376
Dori-darmonlarni o'zi tayyorlar edi, sog'lik ishqibozi edi.

258
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:10,332
Muvaffaqiyatga erishish uchun sog'liq va sabr juda muhim ekan.

259
00:16:10,355 --> 00:16:15,370
Ieyasuning hayot tarzidan ko'p narsalarni o'rganish mumkin.

260
00:16:15,394 --> 00:16:20,528
Imperator saroyi atrofida sayr qilib, tarixni his qilamiz.

261
00:16:20,551 --> 00:16:25,799
Ha, sekin-asta sayr qilib, sayohatdan zavqlanamiz.

262
00:16:25,822 --> 00:16:27,322
7-Sahna: Sakamoto Ryomaning jozibasi

263
00:16:27,322 --> 00:16:33,122
Bu odamning surati juda ham chiroyli ekan-ku!

264
00:16:33,146 --> 00:16:37,279
Bu Sakamoto Ryoma.

265
00:16:37,302 --> 00:16:40,579
Ko'chi prefekturasining qahramoni.

266
00:16:40,602 --> 00:16:43,569
Sakamoto Ryomami?

267
00:16:43,592 --> 00:16:48,959
Oyoqlariga qarasak, etik kiygan ekan.

268
00:16:48,982 --> 00:16:52,230
Juda yaxshi payqadingiz.

269
00:16:52,253 --> 00:16:57,886
O'sha davrning samuraylaridan bo'lib, birinchi marta etik kiygan odam.

270
00:16:57,909 --> 00:17:02,577
Sandallar emas, balki charm etikmi?

271
00:17:02,601 --> 00:17:04,234
Ha.

272
00:17:04,257 --> 00:17:08,835
Chet el madaniyatlariga juda qiziqardi.

273
00:17:08,859 --> 00:17:11,792
U qanday odam edi?

274
00:17:11,815 --> 00:17:18,548
Yangi Yaponiya yaratish uchun mamlakat bo'ylab harakat qilgan inson.

275
00:17:18,571 --> 00:17:21,625
Ura-shuvlar qilganmi edi?

276
00:17:21,648 --> 00:17:23,820
Yo'q.

277
00:17:23,844 --> 00:17:28,119
U suhbat orqali do'stlashtirishda mohir edi.

278
00:17:28,142 --> 00:17:33,175
Dushman bo'lgan guruhlarni ham yarashtirganmi?

279
00:17:33,198 --> 00:17:35,031
Ha.

280
00:17:35,054 --> 00:17:40,888
Satsuma va Choshu kabi kuchli guruhlarni yarashtirdi.

281
00:17:40,911 --> 00:17:44,244
Bu juda katta yutuq!

282
00:17:44,267 --> 00:17:47,322
Qanday qilib ularni ko'ndirdi?

283
00:17:47,345 --> 00:17:53,878
Yaponiya uchun birgalikda ishlaymiz deb aytgan.

284
00:17:53,901 --> 00:17:56,701
Uning dunyoqarashi keng edi.

285
00:17:56,724 --> 00:17:58,535
Ha.

286
00:17:58,559 --> 00:18:03,226
Ryoma kemalar kompaniyasini ham yaratgan.

287
00:18:03,249 --> 00:18:06,459
Yaponiyadagi birinchi kompaniyami?

288
00:18:06,482 --> 00:18:08,132
Ha.

289
00:18:08,156 --> 00:18:12,823
Savdo-sotiq qilib, dunyo bilan bog'lanishga harakat qildi.

290
00:18:12,846 --> 00:18:15,702
Orzusi katta inson ekan!

291
00:18:15,725 --> 00:18:21,492
Yaponiyani yuvishni xohlayman degan mashhur so'zi ham bor.

292
00:18:21,515 --> 00:18:24,374
Yaponiyani yuvishmi?

293
00:18:24,398 --> 00:18:27,364
Qiziqarli ibora ekan-ku!

294
00:18:27,387 --> 00:18:33,554
Eski Yaponiyani tozalab, yangilamoqchi degan ma'noni bildiradi.

295
00:18:33,577 --> 00:18:39,055
Ryoma yangi davr Yaponiyasini koʻrishga muvaffaq boʻldimi?

296
00:18:39,078 --> 00:18:46,083
Afsuski, 31 yoshida kimdir tomonidan oʻldirilgan.

297
00:18:46,106 --> 00:18:47,273
Ha.

298
00:18:47,296 --> 00:18:50,829
Shunchalik yoshida vafot etganmi?

299
00:18:50,852 --> 00:18:52,785
Ha.

300
00:18:52,808 --> 00:18:59,241
Lekin uning gʻoyalari bilan yangi Yaponiya boshlandi.

301
00:18:59,264 --> 00:19:04,864
Koʻchidagi dengiz boʻyida turgan katta Ryoma haykalini koʻrishni xohlardim.

302
00:19:04,887 --> 00:19:06,703
Ha.

303
00:19:06,727 --> 00:19:12,194
Dengizga qaragan Ryoma haykali haqiqatan ham taʼsirli.

304
00:19:12,217 --> 00:19:17,310
Navbatdagi dam olish kunida sayohat rejasini tuzaylik.

305
00:19:17,333 --> 00:19:19,066
Yaxshi ekan!

306
00:19:19,089 --> 00:19:22,423
Mazali katsuo baliq ham yeyishimiz kerak.

307
00:19:22,445 --> 00:19:23,945
8-Sahna: Ninja jozibasi

308
00:19:23,945 --> 00:19:28,379
Dam olish kunida ninja jangari filmi koʻrdim.

309
00:19:28,402 --> 00:19:30,688
Qiziqarli edimi?

310
00:19:30,712 --> 00:19:32,278
Ha.

311
00:19:32,302 --> 00:19:37,868
Ninja devorlarga chiqib, gʻoyib boʻlib ketardi, juda ajoyib edi!

312
00:19:37,891 --> 00:19:41,863
Filmdagi ninja sehrdek tuyuladi.

313
00:19:41,887 --> 00:19:47,220
Yapon tarixida eng mashhur ninja kim?

314
00:19:47,243 --> 00:19:52,443
Hattori Hanzō eng mashhuridir.

315
00:19:52,466 --> 00:19:55,320
Hattori Hanzōmi?

316
00:19:55,344 --> 00:19:58,411
Oʻyinlarda ham uning ismi chiqadi.

317
00:19:58,434 --> 00:20:00,168
Ha, shunday.

318
00:20:00,191 --> 00:20:04,929
Hanzō Tokugava Ieyasuni qoʻriqlaydigan ninja edi.

319
00:20:04,952 --> 00:20:09,719
Qora kiyim kiyib, yuzini yopib yurganmi?

320
00:20:09,742 --> 00:20:14,601
Oddiy samuray kiyimida yurar edi.

321
00:20:14,624 --> 00:20:18,716
Ha, qora kiyimda emasmi?

322
00:20:18,740 --> 00:20:20,540
Ha.

323
00:20:20,563 --> 00:20:25,396
Qora kiyimda aksincha, koʻzni qamashtirib qoʻyadi.

324
00:20:25,419 --> 00:20:27,687
Rostdan ham shunday.

325
00:20:27,711 --> 00:20:31,444
Ninjaning asl ishi nima?

326
00:20:31,467 --> 00:20:37,801
Dushman haqida maʼlumot toʻplash va muhim kishilarni qoʻriqlash.

327
00:20:37,824 --> 00:20:41,190
Faqat jang qilish emas ekan.

328
00:20:41,213 --> 00:20:46,624
Jang qilmasdan, sirli maʼlumotlarni yetkazish asosiy vazifasi edi.

329
00:20:46,648 --> 00:20:51,143
Hattori Hanzō qanday jasoratlar qilgan?

330
00:20:51,166 --> 00:20:57,000
Ieyasu qiyin ahvolda qolganda, uni togʻlardan olib oʻtib xavfsiz joyga yetkazgan.

331
00:20:57,023 --> 00:21:00,756
Ieyasuning jonini saqlab qolganmi?

332
00:21:00,779 --> 00:21:02,412
Ha.

333
00:21:02,435 --> 00:21:07,490
Hanzōning saʼy-harakatlari tufayli Ieyasu tirik qoldi.

334
00:21:07,513 --> 00:21:10,690
Bu katta jasorat!

335
00:21:10,714 --> 00:21:16,994
Hozir ham Tokioda Hanzōmon degan joy nomi qolgan.

336
00:21:17,017 --> 00:21:21,665
Ha, metroning stansiyasi nomi ham shunday.

337
00:21:21,689 --> 00:21:23,822
Ha, shunday.

338
00:21:23,845 --> 00:21:28,679
Avvalgi vaqtlarda oʻsha joyda Hanzōning uyi boʻlgan.

339
00:21:28,702 --> 00:21:33,749
Ninja nomi hozirgi stansiya nomiga aylanganmi?

340
00:21:33,772 --> 00:21:35,261
Ha.

341
00:21:35,284 --> 00:21:39,484
Chunki Ieyasu qal’asining darvozasini qoʻriqlagan.

342
00:21:39,507 --> 00:21:43,362
Ninja juda yaqin tuyuladi.

343
00:21:43,386 --> 00:21:47,998
Asl ninja tarixi haqida bilganda qiziqarli boʻladi.

344
00:21:48,022 --> 00:21:52,855
Koʻproq ninja haqidagi kitoblarni oʻqib koʻraman.

345
00:21:52,878 --> 00:21:54,378
9-Sahna: Yasuke: Yaponiyaning qora tanli samurayi

346
00:21:54,378 --> 00:22:00,811
Yaqinda internetda hayratlanarli yangilikni koʻrdim.

347
00:22:00,834 --> 00:22:03,434
Qanday yangilik?

348
00:22:03,457 --> 00:22:09,540
Avvalgi Yaponiyada qora tanli samuray boʻlgan ekan.

349
00:22:09,564 --> 00:22:13,701
Aa, Yasuke haqida gap ketayapti.

350
00:22:13,724 --> 00:22:17,291
Ha, Yasuke.

351
00:22:17,314 --> 00:22:20,847
Haqiqatan ham mavjud boʻlganmi?

352
00:22:20,870 --> 00:22:23,642
Ha, rost.

353
00:22:23,666 --> 00:22:26,466
Oda Nobunaganing samurayi edi.

354
00:22:26,489 --> 00:22:32,056
Yasuke qayerdan Yaponiyaga kelgan?

355
00:22:32,079 --> 00:22:37,612
Afrikadan italiyaliklar bilan birga kemada keldim.

356
00:22:37,635 --> 00:22:42,609
Nobunaga Yasukeni koʻrib, nima deb oʻyladi?

357
00:22:42,632 --> 00:22:49,399
Dastlab, tanasining qora boʻlishi siyoh surtilgan deb oʻylagan.

358
00:22:49,422 --> 00:22:52,655
Tanasini yuvdirganmisiz?

359
00:22:52,678 --> 00:22:59,612
Ha, tanasini yuvib ham qora ekan, juda hayratda qoldi.

360
00:22:59,635 --> 00:23:04,929
Shunday qilib, Nobunaga Yasukeni yoqtirib qoldi, shundaymi?

361
00:23:04,952 --> 00:23:12,634
Ha, Yasuke juda baland boʻyli va kuchli edi.

362
00:23:12,657 --> 00:23:17,457
Uning kuchi oʻn kishiga teng deb yozilgan.

363
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:24,556
Ha, Nobunaga Yasukega Yasuke deb ism qoʻydi.

364
00:23:24,580 --> 00:23:27,858
Va uni samuray qilib oldimi?

365
00:23:27,881 --> 00:23:34,718
Ha, qilich va uy berib, oʻziga yaqin tutdi.

366
00:23:34,742 --> 00:23:38,949
Yasuke yapon tilida gapira oladimi?

367
00:23:38,972 --> 00:23:44,788
Asta-sekin yapon tilini oʻrganib, Nobunaga bilan suhbatlashgan.

368
00:23:44,812 --> 00:23:49,453
Nobunaga bilan birga jangga ham bordimi?

369
00:23:49,476 --> 00:23:56,209
Ha, Nobunagani himoya qilish uchun oxirigacha birga jang qildi.

370
00:23:56,232 --> 00:24:01,917
Chet ellikning samuray boʻlishi – haqiqatan ham ajoyib!

371
00:24:01,941 --> 00:24:08,015
Hozir xorijiy animelar va filmlarda ham bu haqda koʻp gapiriladi.

372
00:24:08,038 --> 00:24:11,646
Butun dunyo bu haqda qiziqayapti, shundaymi?

373
00:24:11,669 --> 00:24:18,403
Ha, millatidan qatʼi nazar, ajoyib tarix bu.

374
00:24:18,426 --> 00:24:22,159
Yasuke haqidagi animeni koʻrishni xohlardim.

375
00:24:22,182 --> 00:24:26,715
Albatta koʻrib chiqing, juda zoʻr!

376
00:24:26,738 --> 00:24:28,238
10-SAHNA: Abe no Seymey sehrlari / Abe no Seymey: Afsonaviy Onmyoji

377
00:24:28,238 --> 00:24:34,972
Kyoto shahridagi Seymey ziyoratgohiga borishni xohlayman. Seymey ziyoratgohimi?

378
00:24:34,995 --> 00:24:38,280
Abe no Seymey ziyoratgohi, shundaymi?

379
00:24:38,303 --> 00:24:43,270
Abe no Seymey qanday odam edi?

380
00:24:43,293 --> 00:24:49,660
Yaponiyaning qadimiy davrida sehrgar kabi ish bilan shugʻullangan.

381
00:24:49,683 --> 00:24:52,483
Sehrgarmikin?

382
00:24:52,506 --> 00:24:54,672
Qiziqarli ekan.

383
00:24:54,695 --> 00:24:58,065
Onmyoji deb atalgan.

384
00:24:58,089 --> 00:25:01,376
Qanday ishlar bilan shugʻullangan?

385
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:07,253
Yulduzlar va osmonni kuzatib, ob-havoni oldindan aytib bergan.

386
00:25:07,276 --> 00:25:09,916
Ob-havoni oldindan aytib bera olganmi?

387
00:25:09,939 --> 00:25:11,511
Ha.

388
00:25:11,534 --> 00:25:16,801
Taqvim tuzgan, baxt-saodatni bashorat qilgan ham.

389
00:25:16,824 --> 00:25:21,591
Yomon arvohlarni quvib yuborgani rostmi?

390
00:25:21,614 --> 00:25:29,080
Qadim zamonlarda odamlar kasallik va arvohlarni Seymey quvib yuboradi deb ishongan.

391
00:25:29,103 --> 00:25:34,721
Koʻzga koʻrinmas „Shikigami“ deb nomlangan xizmatkorlari boʻlganini eshitganman.

392
00:25:34,745 --> 00:25:36,721
Ha, shunday.

393
00:25:36,745 --> 00:25:41,945
Qogʻoz odamlarni harakatlantirib, ish topshirgan deyiladi.

394
00:25:41,968 --> 00:25:46,101
Aynan fantastik filmdagi dunyoga oʻxshaydi!

395
00:25:46,124 --> 00:25:47,730
Ha.

396
00:25:47,754 --> 00:25:53,687
Shuning uchun romanlar, filmlar va komikslarda koʻp bosh qahramon boʻladi.

397
00:25:53,710 --> 00:25:59,684
Figurali uchish boʻyicha Hanyu sportchisi ham Seymey musiqasidan foydalangan, shundaymi?

398
00:25:59,707 --> 00:26:01,474
Ha.

399
00:26:01,497 --> 00:26:05,764
Oʻsha dastur bilan oltin medalni qoʻlga kiritgan.

400
00:26:05,787 --> 00:26:10,157
Uning libosi va raqsi juda sirli edi.

401
00:26:10,180 --> 00:26:15,788
Turishi va besh qirrali belgisi ham Seymey ramzidir.

402
00:26:15,811 --> 00:26:18,778
Besh qirrali yulduz belgisi, shundaymi?

403
00:26:18,801 --> 00:26:20,434
Ha.

404
00:26:20,457 --> 00:26:25,304
Ziyorathgohda ham koʻp shunday yulduz belgilari bor.

405
00:26:25,328 --> 00:26:28,225
Yovuzlikdan himoya qiluvchi belgi ekanmi?

406
00:26:28,249 --> 00:26:30,315
Ha, shunday.

407
00:26:30,338 --> 00:26:33,872
Yomon narsalarni quvib yuboruvchi belgi.

408
00:26:33,895 --> 00:26:37,579
Seymey necha yoshgacha yashagan?

409
00:26:37,602 --> 00:26:42,808
80 yoshdan oshib, koʻp odamlarga yordam bergan.

410
00:26:42,831 --> 00:26:48,565
Qadim zamonlarda 80 yosh juda uzoq umr ekan.

411
00:26:48,589 --> 00:26:50,047
Ha.

412
00:26:50,071 --> 00:26:55,042
Gʻoyat ajoyib kuchlarga ega boʻlgan daho boʻlishi mumkin.

413
00:26:55,065 --> 00:26:59,509
Ibodatxonada tumor sotib olib, omadimni oshirmoqchiman.

414
00:26:59,533 --> 00:27:02,902
Birga borib, duo qilaylik.